  { number := 103, text := "### 3.1 Lean Machine" },
  { number := 104, text := "" },
  { number := 105, text := "The integration specified by this document: Systems Lean as the compiler component, Legal Lean as the legal proof component, and Holy Lean as the scripture rules component, together as one symbolic proof machine that MUST attempt to answer questions deterministically and MUST timestamp a note when an answer is wrong or imprecise." },
