  { number := 208, text := "### 4.10 Sibling encodings and named gate" },
  { number := 209, text := "" },
  { number := 210, text := "1. Every published numbered markdown file at this repository root SHALL have a sibling Lean spec encoding `NNNN_descriptive_name.lean` at that same root whose physical lines match that markdown, as specified in `0008_Formal_Vibefication.md`." },
  { number := 211, text := "2. Proofs of those encodings SHALL live in `lean/Proofs_NNNN.lean`." },
  { number := 212, text := "3. Mixing those encodings with their proofs in one file is nonconforming as specified in `0008_Formal_Vibefication.md`." },
  { number := 213, text := "4. The Lean program `line_encodings_check` SHALL fail when a markdown line has no encoding or an encoding has no matching markdown line." },
  { number := 214, text := "5. The named gate for this specifications repository remains the gate specified in `0007_CI.md`:" },
